      "comment": "Ravenwood: Wolf's Homecoming Song",
      "content": "A character story in Varka's profile: the first Knight of Boreas used to hum one tune in the tavern every time he returned from a hunt, so the song became a signal of victory; after he left, it faded until Ravenwood claimed the title and the crowds sang it again. Bards have kept it alive since.",
