      ],
      "comment": "Ravenwood: Knight of Boreas lineage",
      "content": "Jean explains that the Wandering Knight left no plan for succession and that Ravenwood's valor earned the Wolf Spirit's recognition; Rosaria says few holders have truly been recognised by Boreas. The wiki lists four known holders: the Wandering Knight, Ravenwood, Rostam and Varka. Roland, a disciple of Rostam, was the best-regarded candidate who never got the title.",
